1 NOTE This GEDCOM is the canonical, version-controlled source of truth for the
2 CONT Hutson family tree. Every genealogical fact carries a SOUR citation that
2 CONT points to a SOUR record at the bottom of the file. Custom tags used:
2 CONT   _URL  = web address of the source
2 CONT   _CONF = confidence level (Primary / Secondary / Tentative / Provided)
2 CONT   _ACC  = date the source was accessed
2 CONT Living individuals are recorded with minimal detail (names and
2 CONT relationships only). Run scripts/build.py after editing this file.
