1 NOTE Paternal grandmother of Miles. Maiden name Liebes, from "Joan Liebes Hutson"
2 CONT in her husband's 2017 obituary. Of Ashkenazi Jewish heritage and lived in San
2 CONT Francisco early in her life (per Miles). RESEARCH LEAD (unproven): "Liebes" is
2 CONT a prominent San Francisco German-Jewish family name - H. Liebes & Co., the
2 CONT major SF furrier founded by Herman Liebes in the 1860s-70s, whose family was
2 CONT active in Congregation Emanu-El. No document yet connects Joan's parents to
2 CONT that family; treat as Tentative until a birth/census record is found.
2 SOUR @S4@
3 _CONF Secondary
