1 TITL D'Olivio v. Hutson - Tex. App. (Dallas) No. 05-20-00969-CV; U.S. Supreme Court docket 23-350
1 AUTH Court of Appeals of Texas, Fifth District; Supreme Court of the United States
1 PUBL Opinion 18 Jul 2022; Texas Supreme Court review denied 24 Mar 2023; certiorari denied 30 Oct 2023
