1 _CONF Primary
1 _ACC 2026-07-11
1 NOTE Court records (primary source) in Brigetta D'Olivio v. Hilary Thompson
2 CONT Hutson. Establish: Richard W. Thompson Jr. and wife Euvonne R. Thompson
2 CONT purchased their Collin County homestead in 1973; Euvonne died 24 Dec 2007;
2 CONT their two living children at that time were Richard W. Thompson III and
2 CONT Hilary Thompson Hutson; on 5 May 2018 Thompson deeded the homestead to
2 CONT himself and Hutson as joint tenants with right of survivorship; his estate
2 CONT was probated as cause PB 1-1381-2019 (Collin County), placing his death
2 CONT about 2019.
